OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRemaining
OL,6,Frather cloudy overnight with perhaps
OL,7,Fsome rain brushing southern parts of
OL,8,FCornwall and south Devon at times.
OL,9,FStaying breezy helping to keep
OL,10,Ftemperatures from falling too low,
OL,11,Falthough winds easing by dawn.
OL,12,
OL,13,CThursday:FAnother cloudy day for many,
OL,14,Falthough some sunshine developing
OL,15,Ftowards the west. Still the risk of
OL,16,Fsome spots of rain, particularly along
OL,17,Fthe south coast. Easterly breeze
OL,18,Fcontinuing to ease.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
