OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FStaying
OL,6,Foften cloudy on Friday with a
OL,7,Fcontinuing risk of some showery rain
OL,8,Fat times. Bright or sunny spells more
OL,9,Flikely over the weekend, with fog
OL,10,Fpatches possible each night.
